---
// Landing page — this is both "home" and "about": your name on the left,
// a short bio on the right. The "about" tab and your name both point here.
//
// The cursor here is a little paper airplane that leaves a dashed flight
// path behind it. All the logic + tuning knobs live in
// src/scripts/paper-plane.ts. (Mouse only; it stays out of the way on
// touch screens and for reduced-motion users.)
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Andrea Chen" heading="Andrea Chen" home>
	<p>Hi! I'm Andrea, a rising sophomore at MIT studying CS & math.</p>
	<p>
		In a past life, I worked on pure math research at PROMYS (&lt;3). I
		enjoyed Thinking About Hard Things, but simultaneously started thinking
		about how lonely pure math research can be&mdash;you end up being one of
		the few people in the world who understand what you&rsquo;re doing and
		why you&rsquo;re doing it&mdash;and wondered how I wanted to impact the
		world.
	</p>

	<p>
		So, I&rsquo;m currently exploring mech
		interp research (read more about my work in
		<a href="/projects"> projects</a>!). I enjoy the immediate feedback
		oop of running a bunch of experiments and seeing fun graphs pop up
		(even though I&rsquo;ve been getting a lot of null results…).
		I chose mech interp mostly because I&rsquo;m fascinated by
		understanding how models work, but I&rsquo;m also trying to care more about AI safety.

	</p>

	<p>
		In my free time, I love talking to my friends, baking (whenever
		I&rsquo;m home), stargazing (SPARC hill my beloved), going on walks,
		and eating sweets with others.
	</p>

	<p class="links">
		<a href="mailto:andreayc@mit.edu">email</a>
		<span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
		<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andreaychen/">linkedin</a>
		<span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
		<a href="https://github.com/andreach3n">github</a>
	</p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.tag {
		color: var(--muted);
		margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
	}
	.links {
		margin-top: 1.75rem;
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
</style>

<!-- Cursor styles are global because the airplane and dashes are created
     by paper-plane.ts and appended to <body>. -->
<style is:global>
	body.plane-cursor,
	body.plane-cursor * {
		cursor: none;
	}
	.plane {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 26px;
		height: 26px;
		margin: -13px 0 0 -13px;
		color: var(--ink);
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 9999;
		will-change: transform;
	}
	.plane svg { display: block; }
	.plane-dash {
		position: fixed;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 9px;
		height: 2px;
		margin: -1px 0 0 -4.5px;
		border-radius: 2px;
		background: var(--muted);
		pointer-events: none;
		z-index: 9998;
		animation: dash-fade 2.4s ease-out forwards;
	}
	@keyframes dash-fade {
		from { opacity: 0.85; }
		to   { opacity: 0; }
	}
</style>

<script>
	import '../scripts/paper-plane';
</script>
